Description: low-latency GNOME streaming for Rockchip
 rkwebscr creates a headless GNOME Wayland display and streams it to a web
 browser over WebRTC. Video capture uses DMA-BUF and Rockchip MPP H.264
 hardware encoding; audio is encoded as Opus.
